# Task: the digest, posted by the schedule

The template the schedule posts each time it fires. A card id is unique on its board, so each
firing is posted as a new card: `t-digest`, then `t-digest.2`, `t-digest.3` and so on. The card
itself is never edited, and the ledger keeps every firing.

```json
{
  "stew": "2026-11-08-draft",
  "kind": "task",
  "id": "t-digest",
  "board": "digest",
  "profile": "daily-digest@1",
  "ask": "Give me the digest of my notes.",
  "source": "schedule",
  "posted_at": "2026-11-08T07:00:00Z"
}
```
